    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie\n\nNo. 18 Barrack Street offers potential for refurbishment or redevelopment (subject to the relevant planning permission). This is an excellent opportunity for those with vision and investment to transform this period red brick property into a more modern home, in a convenient town centre location. \n\nConstructed circa mid to late 1800's, this home is filled with character with its ornate red brick façade being testament to that. Extending to 73 sq.m. / 785 sq.ft. approx., 18 Barrack Street provides cosy living accommodation to include an entrance hall, sitting room, living room (bedroom 3), kitchen and bathroom at ground floor together with two bedrooms at first floor. \n\nBarrack Street is a mature, residential area approximately 1.3km from Dundalk Town Centre (Market Square) and convenient to Navvy Bank walkway, St. Helena's Park, Aura Leisure Centre, Marshes Shopping Centre, Coes Road Industrial Precinct, Northlink Business Park and Dundalk Retail Park. This location cannot be overstated with the N52 Inner Relief Road being only 300 metres from the residence providing easy access to both Dublin & Belfast City via M1 Motorway Junction 16/18. \n\nBe sure to arrange a viewing with us!\n\n**Please note the Vacant and Derelict Homes Grant of upto 70,000 are available from Louth County Council subject to terms and conditons with further SEAI grants also applicable. Please click here for full information. https://www.louthcoco.ie/services/housing/housing-grants/vacant-property-refurbishment-grant/"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGROUND FLOOR - \n\n\nSitting Room - 3.7m x 3.4m\n\n\nLiving Room/Bedroom - 3.6m x 3.2m\n\n\nKitchen - 3.6m x 3.2m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.5m x 1.8m\n\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nMaster Bedroom - 5.1m x 3.4m\n\n\nBedroom - 3.6m x 3.2m\n\n\n - \nTOTAL FLOOR AREA: 854 sq.ft.(79.4 sq.m.) approx.\n\n"
